<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type'>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Welcome to CircuitVerse</h1>
    <% if @organization %>
      <p>
        You have been added to the organization <%= @organization.name %> on CircuitVerse.<br><br>
        Sign up with CircuitVerse to explore the digital world. You can access the organization once you have signed up.
      </p>
    <% else %>
      <p>
        You have been added to a new group named <%= @group.name %> by <%= User.find_by(id: @group.primary_mentor_id)&.name %>.<br><br>
        Sign up with CircuitVerse to explore the digital world. You can use the group once you have signed up with CircuitVerse.
      </p>
    <% end %>
    <br>
    <p>Link to CircuitVerse: <a href="https://www.circuitverse.org">www.circuitverse.org</a></p>
    <p>Have a great day!</p>
  </body>
</html>
